Output part2_results.mp4
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 30

Hide
Type "cd .. && clear && ./kattappa" Enter
Sleep 6s
Wait+Screen@5m /[4-9] clips ready/
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 6s
Type "c"
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 2.5s
Down
Sleep 2.5s
Down
Sleep 2.5s
Up
Sleep 2s
Up
Sleep 2s
Up
Sleep 2.5s
Type "k"
Sleep 2.5s
Down
Sleep 2s
Type "k"
Sleep 6s
Hide
Type "q"
